  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ebadc30a979bf1a7e953d20901c3e7953c575296c0e0bb4af8a458ec3a64ab2c.png] \n\nGiven statement : 144 ÷ 24 × 6 + 12 − 18 = 78\n\nAccording to the question, after interchanging the signs :\n\nSo,\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : 6 and 18\n\n144 ÷ 24 × 6 + 12 − 18 = 78 ⇒ **144 ÷ 24**__ × 18 + 12 − 6 = 78\n\n__**6 × 18**__ + 12 − 6 = 78\n\n__**108 + 12**__ - 6 = 78\n\n__**120 - 6**__ = 78\n\n114 ≠ 78 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : 24 and 12\n\n144 ÷ 24 × 6 + 12 − 18 = 78 ⇒ **144 ÷ 12**__ × 6 + 24 − 18 = 78\n\n__**12 × 6**__ + 24 − 18 = 78\n\n__**72 + 24**__ − 18 = 78\n\n__**96 − 18**__ = 78\n\n**78 = 78 (LHS = RHS)**\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : 24 and 6\n\n144 ÷ 24 × 6 + 12 − 18 = 78 ⇒ **144 ÷ 6**__ × 24 + 12 − 18 = 78\n\n__**24 × 24**__ + 12 − 18 = 78\n\n__**576 **____**+ 12**__ − 18 = 78\n\n__**588 − 18**__ = 78\n\n570 ≠ 78 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : 24 and 18\n\n144 ÷ 24 × 6 + 12 − 18 = 78 ⇒ **144 ÷ 18**__ × 6 + 12 − 24 = 78\n\n__**8 × 6**__ + 12 − 24 = 78\n\n__**48 + 12**__ − 24 = 78\n\n__**60 − 24**__ = 78\n\n36 ≠ 78 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option - (2)\" is the correct answer.",
